              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "આ આંકડા દર્શાવે છે કે ગામમાં વરસાદ ઓછો થયો. ā ā̃kḍā darśāve che ke gāmmā̃ varsād ocho thayo. These figures show that the village has had less rain."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "આંકડો (ā̃kḍo) is built on Sanskrit aṅka, \"a mark, a numeral\" (Monier-Williams)."
